updated_at: "2026-08-22T17:55:35.198Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-22T17:55:35.028Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-22T17:55:35.028Z"
claim_principal: ox-alpha
author: ox-alpha
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T17:54:11.190Z",ox-alpha,"Verified: re-added the pm key programmatically and test/manifest-vocabulary.test.ts failed with a manifest_unknown_key finding; after restoring, the single-file run passes (1 pass/0 fail). Full npm test: 74 tests, 74 pass, 0 fail. release:check exit 0 (changelog already carried unbounded-read --pm-arg flags, no script fix needed). ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exit 0."
