close_reason: "Closed: inert top-level pm key removed from manifest.json after grep confirmed no readers in src/scripts/test; dev CLI pinned exact to 2026.8.22 so manifest_unknown_key detection is active; test/manifest-vocabulary.test.ts added and verified to fail on re-added pm key and pass without it (1/0). npm test 74/74 pass, release:check exit 0, pm health --strict-exit exit 0. No changelog script fix needed."
